within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.S_SensoryOrgans.S01A_Antiinfectives.S01AD05_Interferon;
model Interferon_Qin2025_PD_plt
  "indirect_response_i exposure-response sweep — Qin_2025 :: PLT (platelet)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Interfaces.PartialExposureResponseSweep(
    E0 = 332,      // [109 L−1 day−1]
    Emax = 1,  // type I effect term
    EC50 = 7.24e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng mL−1 × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng mL−1 per second
equation
  response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac);   // steady state, indirect response type I
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 730, Interval = 1.46),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Interferon_Qin2025_PD_plt</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Qin A et al., <i>Pharmacology research &amp; perspectives 13(3):e70109</i> 2025 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/prp2.70109\">doi:10.1002/prp2.70109</a>) — platelet [109 L−1 day−1] against ropeginterferon alfa-2b ng mL−1 — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: indirect_response_i.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =        332 109 L−1 day−1 drug-free response (baseline) (PLTss, Q324)
  Emax  =          1          maximal effect term (I max,P, Q323)
  EC50  =       72.4 ng mL−1  exposure at half of the maximal effect term (IC 50,P, Q322)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <code>response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac)</code>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng mL−1 of ropeginterferon alfa-2b per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 332   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (72.4 ng mL−1)  response 166
  exposure -> infinity  response 0</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Qin_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Interferon_Qin2025_PD_plt;
